## Domain Registry

### Domain Tiers

| Tier | Price | Features | KYC Required |
|------|-------|----------|--------------|
| **Standard** | 100 DALLA | Basic features | Level 1 |
| **Premium** | 500 DALLA | Enhanced features | Level 2 |
| **Government** | 50 DALLA | Subsidized for public sector | Level 2 + Gov ID |
| **Verified** | 1000 DALLA | Blue checkmark verification | Level 3 |

### Registering a Domain

```rust
BNS::register_domain(
    origin,
    domain_name: b"mybusiness".to_vec(),
    tier: 0,  // Standard tier
)?;
```

**Registration Rules:**
- 3-64 characters (alphanumeric + hyphens)
- No leading/trailing hyphens
- Case-insensitive (stored lowercase)
- Permanent ownership (can transfer, cannot expire)
- KYC verification required (prevents squatting)
- Transfer lock: 30 days after registration

---

## Decentralized Web Hosting

### Storage Model

**Manifest Block (Root):**
```json
{
  "type": "website_manifest",
  "version": "1.0",
  "files": {
    "index.html": {
      "hash": "abc123...def456",
      "size": 2048,
      "content_type": "text/html"
    },
    "style.css": {
      "hash": "789ghi...jkl012",
      "size": 1024,
      "content_type": "text/css"
    },
    "logo.png": {
      "hash": "345mno...pqr678",
      "size": 8192,
      "content_type": "image/png"
    }
  },
  "index": "index.html",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T00:00:00Z"
}
```

**File Blocks:**
- Each file (HTML/CSS/JS/image) stored as separate DAG block
- Content-addressable (SHA-256 hash)
- Merkle proofs link to genesis block
- Automatic compression and deduplication

**On-Chain Storage:**
- Only the manifest hash (32 bytes) stored on-chain
- Immutable reference to entire website
- Version history tracked on-chain

### Hosting Tiers

| Tier | Storage | Bandwidth | CDN | Monthly Fee |
|------|---------|-----------|-----|-------------|
| **Free** | 100MB | 1GB | No | 0 DALLA |
| **Basic** | 1GB | 10GB | Yes | 10 DALLA |
| **Pro** | 10GB | 100GB | Premium | 50 DALLA |
| **Enterprise** | 100GB | 1TB | Full | 200 DALLA |

### Activating Hosting

```rust
// Upload website to Pakit DAG storage first
let manifest_hash = pakit.upload_website("mybusiness.bz", "./website_files/").await?;

// Activate hosting on-chain
BNS::activate_hosting(
    origin,
    domain_name: b"mybusiness".to_vec(),
    tier: 1,  // Basic tier
    content_hash: manifest_hash,  // DAG manifest block hash (32 bytes)
    auto_renew: true
)?;
```

### Updating Website Content

```rust
// Upload new version to DAG
let new_manifest_hash = pakit.upload_website("mybusiness.bz", "./updated_files/").await?;

// Update on-chain (saves version history)
BNS::update_hosting_content(
    origin,
    domain_name: b"mybusiness".to_vec(),
    new_content_hash: new_manifest_hash,
    description: b"Version 2.0 - New homepage design".to_vec(),
    size_bytes: 5_242_880  // 5MB
)?;
```

**Content Versioning:**
- Each update saves previous version to history
- Maximum 100 versions per domain
- Rollback to any previous version
- On-chain version audit trail
- Immutable content hashes

### Content Resolution Flow

```
User types "mybusiness.bz" in browser
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│  DNS points to       │
│  Pakit hosting IP    │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│  Hosting Service     │
│  queries BNS pallet  │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│  Returns content_hash│
│  (manifest block)    │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│  Retrieves manifest  │
│  from DAG backend    │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│  Parses file map     │
│  Gets "index.html"   │
│  block hash          │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│  Retrieves HTML      │
│  DAG block           │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│  Serves HTML to user │
└──────────────────────┘
```

