## Domain Marketplace

### Listing a Domain for Sale

```rust
BNS::list_domain_for_sale(
    origin,
    domain_name: b"premium".to_vec(),
    price: 50_000 * DALLA,  // 50,000 DALLA
    expiry_blocks: 86_400,  // 30 days (assuming 6-second blocks)
    min_offer: Some(40_000 * DALLA)  // Accept offers >= 40,000 DALLA
)?;
```

### Buying a Domain

```rust
BNS::buy_domain(
    origin,
    domain_name: b"premium".to_vec()
)?;
```

**Marketplace Mechanics:**
- 5% treasury fee (split: 3% BNS treasury, 2% seller bonus)
- Instant transfer (atomic swap)
- 30-day transfer lock after purchase
- Auto-delist on expiry
- Price negotiation via offers

---

## Domain Resolution

### Setting Resolution Records

```rust
BNS::set_resolution(
    origin,
    domain_name: b"mybusiness".to_vec(),
    wallet_address: Some(account_id),  // Payment routing
    content_hash: Some(manifest_hash),  // Website content
    metadata: br#"{"email":"info@mybusiness.bz","twitter":"@mybusiness"}"#.to_vec()
)?;
```

### Custom Text Records

```rust
BNS::add_text_record(
    origin,
    domain_name: b"mybusiness".to_vec(),
    key: b"email".to_vec(),
    value: b"contact@mybusiness.bz".to_vec()
)?;
```

**Supported Records:**
- Wallet address (BelizeChain account)
- Content hash (DAG manifest for websites)
- Avatar hash (profile picture)
- Metadata (JSON)
- Custom text records (email, social media, URLs, etc.)

---

## External Domain Support

Link traditional domains (`.com/.org/.net`) to your `.bz` identity:

```rust
// Register external domain
BNS::register_external_domain(
    origin,
    external_domain: b"mybusiness.com".to_vec(),
    linked_bns_domain: b"mybusiness".to_vec(),
    tier: 1  // Basic tier
)?;

// Verify ownership (TXT record verification)
BNS::verify_external_domain(
    origin,
    external_domain: b"mybusiness.com".to_vec(),
    verification_code: b"belize-verify-abc123".to_vec()
)?;
```

**Verification Process:**
1. Register external domain on BNS
2. Add TXT record to external DNS: `belize-verify-[code]`
3. Call `verify_external_domain` to confirm ownership
4. Redirect external domain to `.bz` hosting

---

## SSL/TLS Certificate Management

```rust
BNS::update_ssl_certificate(
    origin,
    domain_name: b"mybusiness".to_vec(),
    cert_hash: [0x12, 0x34, ...],  // SHA-256 of certificate
    serial_number: b"ABC123XYZ".to_vec(),
    issuer: b"Let's Encrypt".to_vec(),
    expires_at: 1_000_000  // Block number
)?;
```

**SSL Features:**
- Certificate hash storage on-chain
- Expiry tracking
- Auto-renewal reminders
- Certificate revocation checks

---

## Events

```rust
/// Domain registered
DomainRegistered { domain, owner, tier, price }

/// Domain transferred
DomainTransferred { domain, from, to, price }

/// Hosting activated
HostingActivated { domain, owner, tier, content_hash }

/// Content updated
ContentUpdated { domain, version, content_hash }

/// Content rolled back
ContentRolledBack { domain, version, content_hash }

/// Domain listed for sale
DomainListed { domain, seller, price, expires_at }

/// Domain sold
DomainSold { domain, seller, buyer, price, marketplace_fee }
```

---

## Errors

```rust
DomainNotFound           // Domain doesn't exist
DomainAlreadyRegistered  // Domain name already taken
NotDomainOwner           // Caller doesn't own domain
DomainTooLong            // Exceeds 64 characters
DomainTooShort           // Less than 3 characters
InvalidCharacters        // Non-alphanumeric (except hyphens)
TransferLocked           // Within 30-day lock period
HostingNotActive         // No active hosting subscription
HostingExpired           // Subscription expired
HostingAlreadyActive     // Already has active hosting
InvalidTier              // Invalid tier selection
InsufficientBalance      // Not enough DALLA for fees
InvalidPrice             // Price too low/high
ListingNotFound          // No active marketplace listing
KYCNotVerified           // KYC verification required
```

---

## Storage Items

### DomainRegistry
Maps domain names to ownership records:
```rust
DomainRecord {
    owner: AccountId,
    original_owner: AccountId,  // Permanent record
    registered_at: BlockNumber,
    purchase_price: u128,
    tier: DomainTier,
    locked_until: Option<BlockNumber>,
    transfer_count: u32
}
```

### HostedWebsites
Maps domains to hosting configurations:
```rust
HostingInfo {
    subscriber: AccountId,
    tier: HostingTier,
    content_hash: [u8; 32],  // DAG manifest block hash
    activated_at: BlockNumber,
    last_payment_at: BlockNumber,
    expires_at: BlockNumber,
    data_size: u64,
    monthly_fee: u128,
    auto_renew: bool
}
```

### DomainResolution
Maps domains to resolution records:
```rust
ResolutionRecords {
    wallet_address: Option<AccountId>,
    content_hash: Option<[u8; 32]>,  // DAG manifest hash
    avatar: Option<[u8; 32]>,  // Avatar image hash
    metadata: BoundedVec<u8, 256>,
    text_records: BoundedVec<TextRecord, MaxRecords>
}
```

