## Integration with Other Pallets

### Identity Pallet
- KYC verification for domain registration
- Level 1: Standard domains
- Level 2: Premium/Government domains
- Level 3: Verified domains (blue checkmark)

### Economy Pallet
- DALLA payments for registration and hosting
- Treasury fee collection (5% marketplace)
- Auto-renewal subscriptions

### Compliance Pallet
- Domain content moderation
- DMCA takedown support
- FSC oversight for commercial domains

